{"id":"MOEX-113020-2301-Q086","title":"鬱血性脾腫大：沿門靜脈回流定位原因","version":"accepted","batch":"113-1-med2","sourceSha256":"16e4f76cbb872d47980409484debe0783401c7e65a55f338ff642c46e3a13110","sourceLibraryId":"libfile_5a01acfb690c8191b3796bc453f98a37","sourceAnchor":"q86","shortHtml":"<p>答案是<strong>D，肝硬化</strong>。肝硬化造成肝內血流阻力升高與<strong>門靜脈高壓</strong>，脾臟的靜脈回流受到影響，形成慢性鬱血性脾腫大。A、B、C也都可能與脾臟鬱血有關；本題要選的是四個選項中的<strong>典型最常見原因</strong>，而不是找唯一可能的原因。</p>","html":"<div><h2>鬱血性脾腫大：沿門靜脈回流定位原因</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\">官方最終採計：D</p><h3>先分清「可能造成」與「最常見原因」</h3>\n<p>答案是<strong>D，肝硬化</strong>。肝硬化造成肝內血流阻力升高與<strong>門靜脈高壓</strong>，脾臟的靜脈回流受到影響，形成慢性鬱血性脾腫大。A、B、C也都可能與脾臟鬱血有關；本題要選的是四個選項中的<strong>典型最常見原因</strong>，而不是找唯一可能的原因。</p>\n<h3>沿著兩張圖，把脾臟的回流接到心臟</h3>\n<div>\n<div class=\"reviewed-figure-group\"><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1583px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.5504407443682664\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/9b454749928054b833b4db3bf0f9869383912b6fc0ef39e2b5178113484b45b1.jpg\" alt=\"腹部肝門靜脈系統，橘色脾靜脈與藍綠色上腸繫膜靜脈會合後進入肝門靜脈\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1583\" height=\"1021\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/9b454749928054b833b4db3bf0f9869383912b6fc0ef39e2b5178113484b45b1.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption><strong>進肝之前：</strong>由右側<strong>Splenic（脾靜脈）</strong>的橘色血管往中央追蹤，與上腸繫膜靜脈會合，再經<strong>Hepatic portal（肝門靜脈）</strong>進入肝臟。肝內阻力升高會影響這條上游回流。圖：<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2138_Hepatic_Portal_Vein_System.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenStax College，肝門靜脈系統</a>。</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1817px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.1012121212121213\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/90ef0936c2776c3850fcb1542a5ef01dd0d7a94f54c911bdc0a02999b5d1c879.jpg\" alt=\"胸腹部靜脈，肝靜脈於膈肌下匯入下腔靜脈，向上回流\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1817\" height=\"1650\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/90ef0936c2776c3850fcb1542a5ef01dd0d7a94f54c911bdc0a02999b5d1c879.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption><strong>離肝之後：</strong>找膈肌下方<strong>Hepatic（肝靜脈）</strong>短支，接到<strong>Inferior vena cava（下腔靜脈）</strong>。下腔靜脈最後回到右心房，右心房未畫於此圖。圖：<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2132_Thoracic_Abdominal_Veins.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenStax College，胸腹部靜脈</a>。兩圖皆<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC BY 3.0</a>，完整原圖。</figcaption></figure></div>\n</div>\n<p>把路徑連起來：<strong>脾臟→脾靜脈→門靜脈→肝內血竇→肝靜脈→下腔靜脈→右心房</strong>。注意<strong>門靜脈是進肝，肝靜脈是出肝</strong>，兩者位於這條回流路徑的不同位置。</p>\n<h3>肝硬化如何讓脾臟變大？</h3>\n<p>肝硬化的<strong>纖維化、再生結節及血管結構重塑</strong>提高肝內阻力，並可合併血管張力與內臟循環的改變。門靜脈壓力升高後，脾靜脈回流負荷增加，脾內血液滯留，造成脾臟增大。慢性過程還可伴隨脾組織的增生與重塑，因此長期脾腫大並不只是靜態地「多裝了一點血」。</p>\n<h3>把四個選項放到回流路徑上</h3>\n<div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>選項</th><th>主要受影響位置</th><th>判讀重點</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td><strong>A　心臟衰竭</strong></td><td>回流末端，尤其右心壓力升高時</td><td>可造成肝臟與體靜脈鬱血，也可能影響脾臟；需看心衰竭類型與病程，並非本題最常見答案</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>B　門靜脈血栓</strong></td><td>肝前的門靜脈幹或分支</td><td>阻礙進肝血流，可引起肝前性門靜脈高壓與脾腫大</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>C　脾靜脈血栓</strong></td><td>脾臟的局部回流通道</td><td>可造成<strong>左側／局部門靜脈高壓</strong>，常與胰臟相關疾病有關，也可出現胃靜脈曲張</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>D　肝硬化</strong></td><td>肝內，尤其血竇與相關阻力</td><td><strong>本題最佳答案</strong>；肝內阻力增加造成門靜脈高壓，是鬱血性脾腫大的重要常見背景</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<h3>常考延伸：脾腫大、脾功能亢進與血小板低下</h3>\n<p><strong>脾腫大</strong>描述器官大小；<strong>脾功能亢進</strong>則指脾臟對血球的滯留、清除等作用增加，導致一種或多種周邊血球減少。門靜脈高壓患者常見血小板低下，但肝硬化時還可能有<strong>血小板生成素減少、骨髓抑制或其他因素</strong>共同參與，不能全由脾臟大小推算。</p>\n<p>因此遇到「<strong>肝硬化＋脾腫大＋血小板下降</strong>」，應把門靜脈高壓與脾臟滯留效應連起來；若肝功能相對保留，卻有脾腫大與胃靜脈曲張，則要想到脾靜脈阻塞等局部回流問題。</p>\n<details><summary>原題、答鍵與查核來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：113年第一次醫學（二）原題，第86題</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=S\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：初始標準答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK258/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Clinical Methods：脾腫大與鬱血機轉</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.merckmanuals.com/professional/hepatic-and-biliary-disorders/approach-to-the-patient-with-liver-disease/portal-hypertension\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Merck專業版：門靜脈高壓的病因與表現</a></li><li><a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11224904/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tidwell等：脾靜脈高壓的病因綜述</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.merckmanuals.com/professional/hematology/spleen-disorders/hypersplenism\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Merck專業版：脾功能亢進</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/jnms/90/1/90_JNMS.2023_90-104/_article\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">門靜脈高壓中脾臟的角色：鬱血與組織重塑</a></li><li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2138_Hepatic_Portal_Vein_System.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenStax College：2138 Hepatic Portal Vein System.jpg</a></li><li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2132_Thoracic_Abdominal_Veins.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenStax College：2132 Thoracic Abdominal Veins</a></li></ul></details></div>","imageCount":2,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終採計：D"}